<div class="modal fade" id="settings-modal" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="settings-modal-title">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-xl modal-dialog-scrollable modal-fullscreen-md-down">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <h5 class="modal-title" id="settings-modal-title">設定</h5>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="關閉"></button>
            </div>
            <div id="settings-modal-body" class="modal-body">
                <div id="settings-app" class="settings-app">
                    <ul class="nav nav-tabs" id="settings-tabs" role="tablist">
                        <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
                            <button class="nav-link active" id="tab-interface-btn" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tab-interface" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="tab-interface" aria-selected="true">介面顯示</button>
                        </li>
                        <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
                            <button class="nav-link" id="tab-privacy-btn" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tab-privacy" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="tab-privacy" aria-selected="false">隱私與匿名</button>
                        </li>
                        <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
                            <button class="nav-link" id="tab-keywords-btn" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tab-keywords" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="tab-keywords" aria-selected="false">關鍵字遮蔽</button>
                        </li>
                        <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
                            <button class="nav-link" id="tab-highlight-btn" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tab-highlight" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="tab-highlight" aria-selected="false">訊息高亮</button>
                        </li>
                        <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
                            <button class="nav-link" id="tab-hosts-btn" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tab-hosts" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="tab-hosts" aria-selected="false">主機狀態</button>
                        </li>
                    </ul>

                    <div class="tab-content settings-tab-content">
                        <div class="tab-pane fade show active" id="tab-interface" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-interface-btn">
                            <section class="settings-card">
                                <div class="row g-3 align-items-end">
                                    <div class="col-auto">
                                        <label for="font-base-px-input" class="form-label">字體大小（px）</label>
                                        <input type="number" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="font-base-px-input"
                                               min="12" max="28" step="1" style="width:6rem">
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-auto">
                                        <span id="font-base-px-preview">預覽：今天天氣真好</span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <p class="form-text">這個數值＝對話頁「中」字級的實際大小，「小」「大」會依比例跟著調整；這個視窗本身的文字也會套用同一個大小，背後的聊天畫面也會即時跟著變。</p>

                                <div class="form-check mt-3">
                                    <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="full-width-toggle">
                                    <label class="form-check-label" for="full-width-toggle">對話內容使用全版面寬度</label>
                                </div>
                                <p class="form-text">預設對話最寬佔版面的三分之二（手機版為 75%），長訊息比較好讀；勾選後不分裝置一律用滿整個版面寬度。</p>
                            </section>
                        </div>

                        <div class="tab-pane fade" id="tab-privacy" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-privacy-btn">
                            <section class="settings-card">
                                <div class="mb-3">
                                    <div class="form-check">
                                        <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="display-mode" id="mode-original" value="Original">
                                        <label class="form-check-label" for="mode-original">原名</label>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="form-check">
                                        <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="display-mode" id="mode-mask" value="MaskMiddle">
                                        <label class="form-check-label" for="mode-mask">首尾保留、中間 *</label>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="form-check">
                                        <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="display-mode" id="mode-alias" value="CustomAlias">
                                        <label class="form-check-label" for="mode-alias">自訂別名（沒設定別名的人 fallback 首尾遮蔽）</label>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="form-check">
                                        <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="display-mode" id="mode-anonymous" value="Anonymous">
                                        <label class="form-check-label" for="mode-anonymous">完全匿名（動物／植物代號，如「小熊」）</label>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <p class="form-text">選擇遮蔽、自訂別名或完全匿名時，頭貼會同步換成預設圖示，不會因為照片而看得出真實身分。完全匿名模式下每人會固定拿到一個代號，同一人的代號永遠不變，方便辨認「是不是同一個人在說話」但不會透露是誰。</p>

                                <div id="alias-editor" class="d-none">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <label for="alias-group-filter" class="form-label me-2">篩選群組</label>
                                        <select id="alias-group-filter" class="form-select form-select-sm d-inline-block" style="width:auto"></select>
                                    </div>
                                    <table class="table table-sm">
                                        <thead>
                                            <tr>
                                                <th>使用者</th>
                                                <th>別名</th>
                                                <th></th>
                                            </tr>
                                        </thead>
                                        <tbody id="alias-tbody"></tbody>
                                    </table>
                                </div>
                            </section>

                            <section class="settings-card">
                                <h6 class="settings-card-title">個資自動遮蔽</h6>
                                <p class="form-text">偵測到符合下列格式的文字會自動用星號遮蔽（保留首尾字元），不需要另外設定關鍵字規則。</p>
                                <div class="form-check">
                                    <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="pii-national-id-toggle">
                                    <label class="form-check-label" for="pii-national-id-toggle">身分證字號</label>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-check">
                                    <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="pii-mobile-toggle">
                                    <label class="form-check-label" for="pii-mobile-toggle">手機號碼</label>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-check">
                                    <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="pii-landline-toggle">
                                    <label class="form-check-label" for="pii-landline-toggle">市內電話</label>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-check">
                                    <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="pii-nhi-toggle">
                                    <label class="form-check-label" for="pii-nhi-toggle">健保卡號</label>
                                </div>
                                <p class="form-text">健保卡號的偵測規則是「12 碼純數字」，跟宅配貨運單號（黑貓、新竹貨運等常見業者也是 12 碼數字）格式相同，預設關閉；開啟前請先確認群組內容多半是健保卡號而不是貨運單號，否則會誤遮蔽貨運單號。</p>
                            </section>

                            <section class="settings-card">
                                <h6 class="settings-card-title">訊息保留天數</h6>
                                <p class="form-text">超過這個天數的訊息會在每日排程清除時永久刪除，無法復原。</p>
                                <div class="row g-3 align-items-end">
                                    <div class="col-auto">
                                        <label for="retention-days-input" class="form-label">保留天數</label>
                                        <input type="number" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="retention-days-input"
                                               min="1" max="3650" step="1" style="width:8rem">
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-auto">
                                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" id="retention-save-btn">儲存</button>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </section>
                        </div>

                        <div class="tab-pane fade" id="tab-keywords" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-keywords-btn">
                            <section class="settings-card">
                                <table class="table table-sm align-middle">
                                    <thead>
                                        <tr>
                                            <th>關鍵字</th>
                                            <th>替換方式</th>
                                            <th>套用群組</th>
                                            <th></th>
                                        </tr>
                                    </thead>
                                    <tbody id="keyword-tbody"></tbody>
                                </table>

                                <form id="keyword-form" class="row g-3 align-items-start border-top pt-3">
                                    <div class="col-auto">
                                        <label for="keyword-input" class="form-label">關鍵字</label>
                                        <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="keyword-input" required>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="col-auto">
                                        <span class="form-label d-block">替換方式</span>
                                        <div class="form-check">
                                            <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="replacement-mode" id="replacement-default" checked>
                                            <label class="form-check-label" for="replacement-default">預設（等長 *）</label>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="form-check d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                                            <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="replacement-mode" id="replacement-custom">
                                            <label class="form-check-label" for="replacement-custom">自訂</label>
                                            <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" style="width:8rem" id="replacement-input" disabled>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="col-auto">
                                        <span class="form-label d-block">套用範圍</span>
                                        <div class="form-check">
                                            <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="scope-mode" id="scope-all" checked>
                                            <label class="form-check-label" for="scope-all">全部群組</label>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="form-check">
                                            <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="scope-mode" id="scope-selected">
                                            <label class="form-check-label" for="scope-selected">指定群組</label>
                                        </div>
                                        <div id="scope-group-checkboxes" class="ms-3 mt-1 d-none"></div>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="col-auto align-self-end">
                                        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">新增規則</button>
                                    </div>
                                </form>
                            </section>
                        </div>

                        <div class="tab-pane fade" id="tab-highlight" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-highlight-btn">
                            <section class="settings-card">
                                <h6 class="settings-card-title">高亮關鍵字</h6>
                                <p class="form-text">與「關鍵字遮蔽」重疊的關鍵字不會高亮：遮蔽先套用，文字已經被換成替換字元。</p>
                                <table class="table table-sm align-middle">
                                    <thead>
                                        <tr>
                                            <th>關鍵字</th>
                                            <th>套用群組</th>
                                            <th></th>
                                        </tr>
                                    </thead>
                                    <tbody id="highlight-keyword-tbody"></tbody>
                                </table>

                                <form id="highlight-keyword-form" class="row g-3 align-items-start border-top pt-3">
                                    <div class="col-auto">
                                        <label for="highlight-keyword-input" class="form-label">關鍵字</label>
                                        <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="highlight-keyword-input" required>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="col-auto">
                                        <span class="form-label d-block">套用範圍</span>
                                        <div class="form-check">
                                            <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="highlight-scope-mode" id="highlight-scope-all" checked>
                                            <label class="form-check-label" for="highlight-scope-all">全部群組</label>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="form-check">
                                            <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="highlight-scope-mode" id="highlight-scope-selected">
                                            <label class="form-check-label" for="highlight-scope-selected">指定群組</label>
                                        </div>
                                        <div id="highlight-scope-group-checkboxes" class="ms-3 mt-1 d-none"></div>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="col-auto align-self-end">
                                        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">新增規則</button>
                                    </div>
                                </form>
                            </section>

                            <section class="settings-card">
                                <h6 class="settings-card-title">高亮人員</h6>
                                <table class="table table-sm align-middle">
                                    <thead>
                                        <tr>
                                            <th>名稱</th>
                                            <th>套用範圍</th>
                                            <th></th>
                                        </tr>
                                    </thead>
                                    <tbody id="highlight-user-tbody"></tbody>
                                </table>
                                <p id="highlight-users-empty" class="form-text d-none">尚未加入任何人員。在聊天畫面的成員頭貼上按右鍵（手機長按）即可加入高亮。</p>
                            </section>

                            <section class="settings-card">
                                <h6 class="settings-card-title">顯示效果</h6>
                                <div class="form-check">
                                    <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="highlight-flow-toggle">
                                    <label class="form-check-label" for="highlight-flow-toggle">邊框流動效果</label>
                                </div>
                                <p class="form-text">關閉後邊框仍會發光，但不會流動。系統設定為減少動態效果時一律不流動。</p>

                                <div class="mb-3">
                                    <label class="form-label d-block">預設色票（點擊加入或移除）</label>
                                    <div id="highlight-preset-colors" class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 align-items-center"></div>
                                </div>

                                <div class="row g-2 align-items-center mb-3">
                                    <div class="col-auto">
                                        <label for="highlight-custom-color-input" class="form-label mb-0">自訂顏色</label>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-auto">
                                        <input type="color" class="form-control form-control-color form-control-sm" id="highlight-custom-color-input" value="#06c755" title="選擇自訂顏色">
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-auto">
                                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" id="highlight-add-color-btn">加入自訂顏色</button>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <div class="mb-3">
                                    <label class="form-label d-block">目前選用的顏色（依漸層順序）</label>
                                    <div id="highlight-selected-colors" class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 align-items-center"></div>
                                </div>

                                <div class="highlight-preview-box mt-3">
                                    <div class="highlight-preview-bubble flowing" id="highlight-preview-bubble">這是一則高亮訊息範例 ✨</div>
                                </div>
                            </section>
                        </div>

                        <div class="tab-pane fade" id="tab-hosts" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-hosts-btn">
                            <section class="settings-card">
                                <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center flex-wrap gap-2 mb-3">
                                    <h6 class="settings-card-title mb-0">各主機存活狀態</h6>
                                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" id="host-heartbeats-refresh-btn">重新整理</button>
                                </div>
                                <p class="form-text">每台部署主機（AllInOne／Edge／Core／Viewer）定期回報一次存活狀態；「離線」只代表多久沒收到回報，不代表資料遺失。所有主機的心跳回報間隔（Heartbeat:IntervalSeconds）務必設成一致，狀態燈是以這裡（檢視端）的設定為基準判斷。Edge 這列量的是「Edge→Core 連通性」而非「Edge 是否存活」——Core 掛掉時 Edge 會顯示離線，但 Edge 本身可能仍在正常緩衝。</p>

                                <p id="database-provider-note" class="form-text"></p>

                                <div id="database-fallback-warning" class="alert alert-danger d-none" role="alert"></div>

                                <p id="message-flow-note" class="form-text"></p>

                                <div id="message-flow-warning" class="alert alert-warning d-none" role="alert"></div>

                                <div id="host-heartbeats-fingerprint-warning" class="alert alert-warning d-none" role="alert"></div>

                                <div class="table-responsive">
                                    <table class="table table-sm align-middle">
                                        <thead>
                                            <tr>
                                                <th>角色</th>
                                                <th>主機名稱</th>
                                                <th>狀態</th>
                                                <th>最後回報</th>
                                                <th>通道</th>
                                                <th>Outbox 積壓</th>
                                                <th>加密金鑰指紋</th>
                                                <th class="text-end">操作</th>
                                            </tr>
                                        </thead>
                                        <tbody id="host-heartbeats-tbody"></tbody>
                                    </table>
                                </div>
                                <p id="host-heartbeats-empty" class="form-text d-none">目前還沒有任何主機回報過心跳。</p>
                            </section>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
